<text:h text:outline-level="1">Sales report</text:h>
<text:p>Revenue in 2024 was <text:change text:change-id="ct1"/><text:change-start text:change-id="ct2"/>135<text:change-end text:change-id="ct2"/> billion won.</text:p>
<text:p><office:annotation office:name="c1"><dc:creator>Kim Minji</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-11-20T11:00:00</dc:date><text:p>Needs a source.</text:p></office:annotation>Revenue in 2024 was <office:annotation-end office:name="c1"/>120 billion won.</text:p>
<text:p><text:change-start text:change-id="ct3"/>This paragraph was inserted by a reviewer.</text:p><text:p><text:change-end text:change-id="ct3"/>The team grew to <text:change-start text:change-id="ct5"/><text:span text:style-name="B">12 people</text:span><text:change-end text:change-id="ct5"/>.<office:annotation><dc:creator>Kim Minji</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-11-20T11:05:00</dc:date><text:p>Check the headcount.</text:p></office:annotation></text:p>
<text:p><text:change text:change-id="ct4"/>The team grew to 12 people.</text:p>
